  "source": [
    {
      "kind": "client",
      "evidence": "Global.Text 75450 'Thugawug Thug!' (title, the starter's own name), 77891 (card), 77893 (goal); icon 310. Local Hero's own block: 389186 'These thugawugs stole my bag!', 389192 'Defeat the Thugawug Thug in south Greenwood Forest', 389194 'He's the leader of these unruly thugawugs'."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reference",
      "evidence": "BJX fork Resources/Battles.json Id 60 ('Thugawug Thug! (the live random encounter: a band of thugawug thugs)'): starter Npc 4115, scene sg_random_encounter_02 (zone 1242), difficulty 2, 30 coins, no boss. Waves: 3x Npc 3460 Bandit Patrolman; 3x 3491 (the fork's Npcs.json names it Thugawug Stomper, name 440717); 3x 46144 Thugawug Ambusher (name 100883, model 199) and 1x 3460. Every spot here is the fork's."
    },
    {
      "kind": "legacy-data",
      "evidence": "FreeRealms-Legacy FabledRealms.lua:2781 spawns Npc 4115 'Thugawug Thug!' (Npcs.json: name 75450, model 199 chugawug_m_bandit_01.adr) at (-2018.592, -36.7976, -540.6624)."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) L1193: Npc 3460 is the shipped bandit_patrolman (3460) and the fork's 3491 Stomper the shipped thugawug_stomper (950013), with their barks; the Ambusher has no definition, so it is fight-local 1408001 (as 1404301 is the Tavern Cellar's brawler) with the Patrolman's barks. Rules copy Hooligan Brawling Club! (14017); the job XP and wheel copy Robgoblin Troublemakers! (14022), a difficulty-2 random encounter, as the wiki gives this battle no wheel of its own. Not proven in the client yet."
    },
    {"kind": "reconstructed", "evidence": "(R) Not proven in the client: this scene needs one native load, and the starter of `entry` is drawn by the entrances work (`thugawug_thug`, the Legacy body 100000004115), not by this file. Each kind's rank here decides its health and hit at the fight's tier."}
  ]
